---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q40"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |  Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   Sort: PageViews DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     Projection: hits.TraficSourceID, hits.SearchEngineID, hits.AdvEngineID, CASE WHEN hits.SearchEngineID = Int64(0) AND hits.AdvEngineID = Int64(0) THEN hits.Referer ELSE Utf8("") END AS Src, hits.URL AS Dst, count(Int64(1)) AS PageViews                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.TraficSourceID, hits.SearchEngineID, hits.AdvEngineID, CASE WHEN CAST(hits.SearchEngineID AS Int64) = Int64(0) AND CAST(hits.AdvEngineID AS Int64) = Int64(0) THEN hits.Referer ELSE CAST(Utf8("") AS LargeUtf8) END, hits.URL]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL, Referer, TraficSourceID, SearchEngineID, AdvEngineID], full_filters=[CAST(hits.CounterID AS Int64) = Int64(62), to_timestamp(CAST(hits.EventDate AS Int64) * Int64(86400)) >= CAST(Utf8("2013-07-01") AS Timestamp(ns)), to_timestamp(CAST(hits.EventDate AS Int64) * Int64(86400)) <= CAST(Utf8("2013-07-31") AS Timestamp(ns)), CAST(hits.IsRefresh AS Int64) = Int64(0)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT "hits"."TraficSourceID", "hits"."SearchEngineID", "hits"."AdvEngineID", CASE WHEN ((CAST("hits"."SearchEngineID" AS BIGINT) = 0) AND (CAST("hits"."AdvEngineID" AS BIGINT) = 0)) THEN "hits"."Referer" ELSE CAST('' AS TEXT) END AS "Src", "hits"."URL" AS "Dst", count(1) AS "PageViews" FROM "hits" WHERE ((((CAST("hits"."CounterID" AS BIGINT) = 62) AND (to_timestamp((CAST("hits"."EventDate" AS BIGINT) * 86400)) >= CAST('2013-07-01' AS TIMESTAMP))) AND (to_timestamp((CAST("hits"."EventDate" AS BIGINT) * 86400)) <= CAST('2013-07-31' AS TIMESTAMP))) AND (CAST("hits"."IsRefresh" AS BIGINT) = 0)) GROUP BY "hits"."TraficSourceID", "hits"."SearchEngineID", "hits"."AdvEngineID", CASE WHEN ((CAST("hits"."SearchEngineID" AS BIGINT) = 0) AND (CAST("hits"."AdvEngineID" AS BIGINT) = 0)) THEN "hits"."Referer" ELSE CAST('' AS TEXT) END, "hits"."URL" ORDER BY "PageViews" DESC NULLS FIRST LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
